Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 16:52:33 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/6] phyFLEX-stm32mp2 M33 helloworld example: stm32cubemp2
 v1.3.2

   The default USART_Communication_Rx_IT example has the following behavior:

   - triggers an interrupt whenever serial data is input on UART_RX.
   - the USART interrupt handler toggles a LED ON if the serial data matches a 's' or 'S'.
   - a different interrupt fires whenever the User Button is pressed
   - The Userbutton interrupt handler turns the LED OFF

   Here we are changing the example to OUTPUT serial instead in a loop (and the Userbutton
   interrupt handler starts/stops it), since most people expect something like a HelloWorld
   to start.

Signed-off-by: True Loan <tloan@phytec.com>
---
 .../CM33/NonSecure/Inc/main.h                 | 18 ++---
 .../CM33/NonSecure/Src/main.c                 | 67 +++++++++++++++----
 .../CM33/NonSecure/Src/stm32mp2xx_it.c        |  2 +
 3 files changed, 65 insertions(+), 22 deletions(-)

